description.narrative:
Regional & Continental Actors: 

African Union (AU) Peace and Security Council; 
AU Permanent Representatives Committee;
AU Political Affairs, Peace and Security Department (PAPS); 
Councellors & technical officers to African Ambassadors, Committee of Experts to the PSC;
Country officers, RECs liaison officers to the AU; Defence Attachés of AU Member States; and general Addis Ababa policy community. 

National Level Actors: 

Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Ministry of Peace, Institute for Strategic Affairs amd other government agencies working on peace and security areas.
